+ * Threading model
+ *  - ONE process-wide display thread owns SDL (SDL_Init/SDL_Quit of the audio subsystem), runs the commands of every
+ *    instance and video_refresh(), which hands due pictures to the instance's presenter.
+ *  - Each instance keeps ffplay's read and decode threads.
+ *  - The public API is thread safe: control calls append a command to the
